      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GUIDERIUS.\nThere is cold meat i’ th’ cave; we’ll browse on that\nWhilst what we have kill’d be cook’d.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
