      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BELARIUS.\nBy Jupiter, an angel! or, if not,\nAn earthly paragon! Behold divineness\nNo elder than a boy!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
