      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ARVIRAGUS.\nAll gold and silver rather turn to dirt,\nAs ’tis no better reckon’d but of those\nWho worship dirty gods.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
