      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "IMOGEN.\n’Mongst friends,\nIf brothers. [Aside.] Would it had been so that they\nHad been my father’s sons! Then had my prize\nBeen less, and so more equal ballasting\nTo thee, Posthumus.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 39,
          "end": 45
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
